  ["Out of combat, a buff your rotation expects is put in slot 1 when it is missing or runs out within 5 minutes: raid buffs (on you or anyone in range), shields, weapon imbues, poisons, and Earth Shield or Beacon of Light on your tank. Combat > Buff reminders switches it off."] = "脱战时，如果循环需要的增益缺失或 5 分钟内到期，会放到第 1 格：团队增益（你或范围内的任何人）、护盾、武器强化、毒药，以及坦克身上的大地之盾或圣光道标。战斗 > 增益提醒 可关闭。",
  ["Out of combat, a missing buff goes in slot 1: raid buffs, shields, weapon imbues, poisons, and Earth Shield or Beacon of Light on your tank. Each can be hidden on the Spells & trinkets page."] = "脱战时，缺失的增益放到第 1 格：团队增益、护盾、武器强化、毒药，以及坦克身上的大地之盾或圣光道标。每一项都可在“技能和饰品”页面隐藏。",
