  ["Right after it happens: /dmga report (or the minimap menu, or Status > Report an issue). Step 1: say what went wrong. Step 2: Ctrl+C copies your words and the report together. Step 3: open the link and paste it into a new issue. /dmga help lists every command."] = "问题发生后立即：/dmga report（或小地图菜单，或 状态 > 报告问题）。第 1 步：说明哪里出了问题。第 2 步：Ctrl+C 会把你的描述和报告一起复制。第 3 步：打开链接并粘贴到新的 issue 中。/dmga help 列出所有命令。",
