  ["Download (CurseForge)"] = "下载（CurseForge）",
  ["Below max level, and for a new character's starter spec, Blizzard's Assisted Combat leads while you know few of the spells the priority list expects; DMGAssist's list takes over by itself as you learn more. New spells without a key and unspent talent points get one chat line. Combat > Leveling."] = "在满级之前，以及新角色的初始专精，只要你只会优先级列表所需技能中的一小部分，就由暴雪的辅助战斗主导；随着你学会更多，DMGAssist 的列表会自动接手。没有按键的新技能和未分配的天赋点会在聊天框提示一行。战斗 > 升级。",
  ["Fits your UI"] = "融入你的界面",
  ["Move the HUD in Blizzard's Edit Mode. Masque skins the icons. With a controller, keybinds show as its buttons (Display > Controller button names). Titan Panel and ElvUI data texts get a DMGAssist launcher. Addon authors: DMGAssistAPI."] = "在暴雪的编辑模式中移动 HUD。Masque 可美化图标。使用手柄时，按键显示为手柄按钮（显示 > 手柄按键名称）。Titan Panel 和 ElvUI 信息文字会有 DMGAssist 启动器。插件作者：DMGAssistAPI。",
  ["DMGAssist is off for %s. /dmga spec on turns it back on."] = "DMGAssist 已在 %s 关闭。/dmga spec on 可重新开启。",
  ["DMGAssist is on for %s."] = "DMGAssist 已在 %s 开启。",
  ["DMGAssist on or off for the spec you are in (an alt's healing spec, for example)"] = "为当前专精开启或关闭 DMGAssist（例如小号的治疗专精）",
  ["Like your action bars: an icon turns red when your target is out of that spell's range, and slot 1 turns blue when you are short of resource for it."] = "和动作条一样：目标超出该技能射程时图标变红；资源不足时第 1 格变蓝。",
  ["Use DMGAssist on this spec"] = "在此专精使用 DMGAssist",
  ["Out of range and resource colors"] = "射程和资源颜色",
  ["list recommended spells that have no keybind"] = "列出可推荐但没有绑定按键的技能",
  ["test the defensive alert (8 seconds)"] = "模拟首领插件要求减伤（8 秒），检查是否显示",
  ["refresh keybinds"] = "刷新按键",
  ["report an issue or give feedback: describe it, copy the report, open the issue page"] = "报告问题或提出反馈：描述问题、复制报告、打开 issue 页面",
  ["save a full decision trace for troubleshooting"] = "保存完整的决策记录用于排查问题",
  ["test the interrupt alert, Assisted Combat, or boss mod detection"] = "测试打断、暴雪助手和首领插件检测",
  ["the three setup questions again (where, how big, when to show)"] = "再次回答三个设置问题（位置、大小、何时显示）",
  ["Use DMGAssist on %s"] = "在%s使用 DMGAssist",
  ["Reload the interface now to switch the language?"] = "现在重新加载界面以切换语言？",
  ["Reload now"] = "立即重载",
  ["Later"] = "稍后",
  ["Learned timing"] = "已学习的计时",
  ["Forget learned timing"] = "清除已学习的计时",
  ["DMGAssist learns how long your cooldowns really take, including talents, gear and haste it can't see, and which spells to leave to Blizzard's assistant. It's saved for your whole account and gets better as you play. Forget it to start over, for example after a big talent or gear change. Your settings are kept."] = "DMGAssist 会学习你的冷却实际需要多长时间（包括它看不到的天赋、装备和急速），以及哪些法术交给暴雪的辅助战斗来判断。数据保存在整个账号中，玩得越多越准确。想重新开始时可以清除，例如大幅更换天赋或装备之后。你的设置会保留。",
  ["Learned cooldown timing forgotten. DMGAssist learns again from your next fight."] = "已清除学习到的冷却计时。DMGAssist 将从下一场战斗开始重新学习。",
  ["Not in combat: try again after the fight."] = "战斗中无法操作：请在战斗结束后重试。",
  ["forget learned cooldown timing and start learning again"] = "清除学习到的冷却计时并重新学习",
  ["Slot 1 changes"] = "第1格切换",
  ["Steady (recommended)"] = "稳定（推荐）",
  ["Fast"] = "快速",
  ["Steady: once you're about to press, slot 1 stays put; a spell that becomes ready at that moment shows in slot 2 and moves up after your press. Fast: slot 1 follows every change sooner, for players who react quickly."] = "稳定：在你即将按键时，第1格保持不变；此刻刚好就绪的法术显示在第2格，按键后再上移。快速：第1格更早跟随每次变化，适合反应快的玩家。",
  ["A dark edge around the letters keeps them readable on bright icons."] = "文字周围的深色描边让它们在明亮的图标上也清晰可读。",
  ["A dark panel behind the icons."] = "图标后面的深色底板。",
  ["A glow around slot 1. Only slot 1 moves, so it always draws your eye first."] = "第1格周围的光效。只有第1格会动，所以它总是最先吸引你的目光。",
  ["A line around the frame."] = "框体周围的线条。",
  ["A pick DMGAssist isn't sure about (the game hides a value it needs) is shown slightly faded."] = "DMGAssist 不确定的选择（游戏隐藏了所需的数值）会以略淡的样子显示。",
  ["A small gold-edged icon on slot 1 for an on-use trinket or a potion, when it's time to use it. Quieter than the red one: worth pressing, never urgent."] = "第1格上的金色边框小图标，用于该使用的主动饰品或药水。比红色的低调：值得按，但从不紧急。",
  ["A small red-edged icon on slot 1 for everything that keeps you alive, for every class: defensive cooldowns, self-heals, tank mitigation like Ironfur. It pulses while you need it now."] = "第1格上的红色边框小图标，用于所有职业保命的一切：防御冷却、自我治疗、坦克减伤（如铁鬃）。需要立即使用时会闪动。",
  ["A sound for each kind of alert, so you hear it even when you're not looking. Choose None to silence one."] = "每种提醒都有一个声音，即使没在看也能听到。选择“无”可将其静音。",
  ["A thin bar under slot 1 that empties with your global cooldown."] = "第1格下方随公共冷却减少的细条。",
  ["Action bars and keybinds"] = "动作条和按键",
  ["Alerts and effects"] = "提醒和效果",
  ["All DMGAssist sounds on or off."] = "开启或关闭 DMGAssist 的所有声音。",
  ["Answer the first-time questions again, bind keys, or start over."] = "重新回答首次设置的问题、绑定按键或从头开始。",
  ["Before big hits and when your health is low, a defensive cooldown appears in the red-edged defensive icon on slot 1, pulsing."] = "在大伤害之前以及血量低时，防御技能会出现在第1格的红色边框防御图标中并闪动。",
  ["Blizzard's Assisted Combat"] = "暴雪的辅助战斗",
  ["DBM, BigWigs and LittleWigs warn about upcoming hits, adds and casts, so defensives and interrupts come on time."] = "DBM、BigWigs 和 LittleWigs 会预警即将到来的伤害、小怪和施法，让防御和打断及时出现。",
  ["Defensive icon (staying alive)"] = "防御图标（保命）",
  ["Discipline Priest: Atonement"] = "戒律牧师：救赎",
  ["Extra space between slot 1 and slot 2, so slot 1 stands apart and its small icons have room."] = "第1格和第2格之间的额外间距，让第1格更突出，其小图标也有空间。",
  ["For characters below max level, or with talents far from the usual build."] = "适用于未满级或天赋与常见构筑相差很大的角色。",
  ["For tanks: how many stacks of your mitigation buff are up (Guardian Druid: Ironfur), counted from your casts."] = "坦克用：你的减伤增益有多少层（守护德鲁伊：铁鬃），根据你的施法计数。",
  ["Frame and title"] = "框体和标题",
  ["Getting started"] = "开始使用",
  ["Healing spells in your own kit, for damage dealers and tanks (not healer rotations)."] = "你自身技能中的治疗法术，适用于输出和坦克（不是治疗循环）。",
  ["Hide the icons outside combat (they still show with an enemy targeted, if the next option is on)."] = "脱战时隐藏图标（若开启下一选项，选中敌人时仍会显示）。",
  ["Hide the icons when you don't need them."] = "不需要时隐藏图标。",
  ["Hide the icons while you're in a vehicle (one with its own action bar)."] = "在载具（带有自己动作条的）中时隐藏图标。",
  ["How DMGAssist decides between the single-target and the multi-target rotation."] = "DMGAssist 如何在单体循环和多目标循环之间选择。",
  ["How big the icons are and the space between them. To move them, unlock on the first page and drag, or use Blizzard's Edit Mode."] = "图标的大小和间距。要移动它们，请在第一页解锁后拖动，或使用暴雪的编辑模式。",
  ["How dark the background panel is."] = "背景底板的深浅。",
  ["How many icons: slot 1 is the spell to press now, slots 2 and 3 are what comes after it."] = "显示几个图标：第1格是现在要按的法术，第2、3格是之后的。",
  ["How many spells are shown, and which kinds of spells DMGAssist may suggest."] = "显示多少个法术，以及 DMGAssist 可以推荐哪些类型的法术。",
  ["How solid slots 2 and 3 are. A little lower keeps your eye on slot 1."] = "第2、3格的不透明度。稍低一点能让视线停在第1格。",
  ["How solid the whole HUD is: lower lets you see through it."] = "整个界面的不透明度：越低越能看穿。",
  ["How the icons tell you when to press, and what needs your attention most."] = "图标如何提示你何时按键，以及什么最需要你注意。",
  ["How visible that line is."] = "该线条的可见程度。",
  ["In combat the game hides some values from addons (combo points, for example). How to handle them."] = "战斗中游戏会对插件隐藏一些数值（例如连击点）。如何处理它们。",
  ["In combat, at or below this much health a defensive is suggested."] = "战斗中，生命值低于或等于此值时会推荐防御技能。",
  ["Items icon (trinkets and potions)"] = "物品图标（饰品和药水）",
  ["Its size, as a percentage of slot 1. Larger also covers more of slot 1: move it out with the sliders below."] = "大小，为第1格的百分比。越大也会遮住更多第1格：用下面的滑块把它移开。",
  ["Keybinds and spell names"] = "按键和法术名称",
  ["Move down / up"] = "向下 / 向上移动",
  ["Move left / right"] = "向左 / 向右移动",
  ["NOW above slot 1 and NEXT above slots 2 and 3."] = "第1格上方显示“现在”，第2、3格上方显示“下一个”。",
  ["Nudges it down (below 0) or up (above 0), in pixels, so it doesn't cover slot 1."] = "以像素向下（小于0）或向上（大于0）移动，避免遮住第1格。",
  ["Nudges it left (below 0) or right (above 0), in pixels, so it doesn't cover slot 1."] = "以像素向左（小于0）或向右（大于0）移动，避免遮住第1格。",
  ["Only for Discipline Priests: spread Atonement before big group damage."] = "仅限戒律牧师：在大范围团队伤害前铺开救赎。",
  ["Optional lines and decoration around the icons."] = "图标周围可选的线条和装饰。",
  ["Out of combat, hide the icons while you're mounted."] = "脱战时骑乘坐骑会隐藏图标。",
  ["Position"] = "位置",
  ["Potion: %s. Shown in the items icon when SimC uses a potion (with your big cooldowns). Right-click the box to remove it."] = "药水：%s。当 SimC 使用药水时（配合你的大冷却）显示在物品图标中。右键点击方框可移除。",
  ["Potion: drag a potion from your bags onto this box to add it to your rotation (this spec only). It shows in the items icon when SimC uses a potion."] = "药水：把背包里的药水拖到这个方框，即可加入你的循环（仅限此专精）。当 SimC 使用药水时会显示在物品图标中。",
  ["Profiles"] = "配置文件",
  ["Settings can be shared by all your characters (Default) or kept for this character only."] = "设置可以由所有角色共享（默认），也可以只为此角色保存。",
  ["Setup and reset"] = "设置和重置",
  ["Show a defensive cooldown (Barkskin, Shield Wall, Survival of the Fittest...) in the defensive icon when you need one."] = "需要时在防御图标中显示防御技能（树皮术、盾墙、适者生存……）。",
  ["Show the key that casts each spell on its icon."] = "在每个图标上显示施放该法术的按键。",
  ["Show the spells to press. Off hides the icons completely (the key binding and /dmga on | off do the same)."] = "显示要按的法术。关闭则完全隐藏图标（按键绑定和 /dmga on | off 也一样）。",
  ["Show your interrupt (Kick, Pummel, Wind Shear...) in slot 1 when your target casts something interruptible."] = "目标施放可打断的法术时，在第1格显示你的打断技能（脚踢、拳击、风剪……）。",
  ["Show your on-use trinkets when they are ready, in combat, at the moments SimC uses them (with your cooldowns)."] = "在战斗中、SimC 使用它们的时刻（配合你的冷却）显示已就绪的主动饰品。",
  ["Shows, for 8 seconds, the defensive DMGAssist would suggest before a big hit, in the defensive icon."] = "在防御图标中显示8秒钟：大伤害前 DMGAssist 会推荐的防御技能。",
  ["Single target or AoE"] = "单体或群体",
  ["Size"] = "大小",
  ["Size and spacing"] = "大小和间距",
  ["Some cooldowns are saved or spent depending on how long the fight is expected to last."] = "一些冷却会根据预计的战斗时长保留或使用。",
  ["Space after the main icon"] = "主图标后的间距",
  ["Stack counter"] = "层数计数",
  ["The color of the key text."] = "按键文字的颜色。",
  ["The color of the spell names."] = "法术名称的颜色。",
  ["The font for keybinds, spell names and labels on the icons."] = "图标上按键、法术名称和标签使用的字体。",
  ["The game's own rotation helper. DMGAssist asks it about things the game hides from addons."] = "游戏自带的循环助手。DMGAssist 会向它询问游戏对插件隐藏的信息。",
  ["The size of everything at once, icons and text."] = "所有内容的大小，包括图标和文字。",
  ["The size of slot 1, the spell to press now."] = "第1格（现在要按的法术）的大小。",
  ["The size of slots 2 and 3, what comes next."] = "第2、3格（接下来的）的大小。",
  ["The size of the callout text."] = "提示文字的大小。",
  ["The size of the key text."] = "按键文字的大小。",
  ["The size of the spell names."] = "法术名称的大小。",
  ["The size of the stack number."] = "层数数字的大小。",
  ["The sound played for this alert."] = "此提醒播放的声音。",
  ["The space between each icon."] = "每个图标之间的间距。",
  ["The space between the icons and the frame's edge (visible with a background or border)."] = "图标与框体边缘的间距（有背景或边框时可见）。",
  ["The spell's name under each icon."] = "每个图标下方的法术名称。",
  ["The text on and under the icons."] = "图标上和下方的文字。",
  ["Tools for finding out why DMGAssist picked something, and for reporting a problem."] = "用于查明 DMGAssist 为何做出某个选择以及报告问题的工具。",
  ["Trinkets you activate yourself. A ready one appears in the gold-edged items icon on slot 1 (bottom-left by default); press it alongside slot 1."] = "你自己激活的饰品。就绪时出现在第1格的金色边框物品图标中（默认左下）；与第1格一起按。",
  ["Turn DMGAssist on or off, move it, and pick its language. Everything else is on the pages below: Combat (what it recommends), Display (how it looks), Sounds, Integrations, Advanced."] = "开启或关闭 DMGAssist、移动它并选择语言。其他内容都在下面的页面：战斗（推荐什么）、显示（外观）、声音、整合、高级。",
  ["Used when \"Fight length\" is Custom: the fight length assumed, in seconds."] = "当“战斗时长”为自定义时使用：假定的战斗时长（秒）。",
  ["What to recommend"] = "推荐内容",
  ["When the icons show"] = "何时显示图标",
  ["Where DMGAssist finds the key for each spell: Blizzard's bars, Bartender, ElvUI, Dominos."] = "DMGAssist 从哪里获取每个法术的按键：暴雪动作条、Bartender、ElvUI、Dominos。",
  ["Where the key text sits on the icon."] = "按键文字在图标上的位置。",
  ["Where the stack number sits."] = "层数数字的位置。",
  ["Which part of slot 1 it sits on. Bottom-left by default."] = "位于第1格的哪个位置。默认左下。",
  ["Which part of slot 1 it sits on. Top-left by default."] = "位于第1格的哪个位置。默认左上。",
  ["Your interrupt takes slot 1 when an enemy casts something worth stopping."] = "敌人施放值得打断的法术时，你的打断技能会占据第1格。",
  ["Top-left corner"] = "左上角",
  ["Bottom-left corner"] = "左下角",
  ["Bottom-right corner"] = "右下角",
  ["Settings open as soon as the game allows it (after combat)."] = "游戏允许后（战斗结束后）将立即打开设置。",
  ["No potions in your bags"] = "背包里没有药水",
  ["Potion for this spec"] = "此专精的药水",
  ["Potion removed for this spec."] = "已移除此专精的药水。",
  ["Potion set for this spec: %s."] = "此专精的药水：%s。",
  ["Potion: %s. Shown in the items icon when SimC uses a potion (with your big cooldowns). Click the box to change it, right-click to remove it."] = "药水：%s。当 SimC 使用药水时（配合你的大冷却）显示在物品图标中。点击方框可更换，右键可移除。",
  ["Potion: click this box and pick one of the potions in your bags to add it to your rotation (this spec only). It shows in the items icon when SimC uses a potion."] = "药水：点击这个方框，从背包里的药水中选择一个加入你的循环（仅限此专精）。当 SimC 使用药水时会显示在物品图标中。",
  ["Type /dmga potion and shift-click a potion to choose it."] = "输入 /dmga potion 并按住 Shift 点击药水即可选择。",
  ["choose the potion for this spec (shift-click it), or /dmga potion off"] = "选择此专精的药水（按住 Shift 点击），或 /dmga potion off",
  ["Addons DMGAssist works with:"] = "DMGAssist 可配合使用的插件：",
  ["Check"] = "检查",
  ["DMGAssist works with these when they are installed, with nothing to set up: Masque skins its icons, ElvUI, Bartender and Dominos bars give the keybinds, Titan Panel and ElvUI get a launcher, WeakAuras can read its picks."] = "安装后 DMGAssist 会自动配合这些插件，无需设置：Masque 为图标换肤，ElvUI、Bartender 和 Dominos 的动作条提供按键，Titan Panel 和 ElvUI 获得启动按钮，WeakAuras 可以读取推荐。",
  ["Lists in chat each supported addon: in use, found, or not installed (also /dmga addons)."] = "在聊天中列出每个支持的插件：使用中、已找到或未安装（也可用 /dmga addons）。",
  ["Other addons"] = "其他插件",
  ["Other addons in use"] = "正在使用的其他插件",
  ["Preview. Back in its place when you close the settings."] = "预览。关闭设置后会回到原位。",
  ["Which addons are in use"] = "哪些插件正在使用",
  ["icon skins"] = "图标皮肤",
  ["keybinds read from its bars"] = "从其动作条读取按键",
  ["keybinds from its bars, data text launcher"] = "从其动作条读取按键，信息文字启动按钮",
  ["launcher in Titan Panel"] = "Titan Panel 中的启动按钮",
  ["boss mod warnings"] = "首领插件警报",
  ["can read DMGAssist's picks (DMGAssistAPI)"] = "可以读取 DMGAssist 的推荐（DMGAssistAPI）",
  ["in use"] = "使用中",
  ["found"] = "已找到",
  ["which supported addons (Masque, ElvUI, Bartender, boss mods...) are found and in use"] = "哪些支持的插件（Masque、ElvUI、Bartender、首领插件……）已找到并在使用",
  ["Written and maintained by %s"] = "作者与维护者：%s",
  ["linked"] = "已关联",
  ["Move the HUD in Blizzard's Edit Mode. Masque skins the icons. With a controller, keybinds show as its buttons (Display > Controller button names). Addon authors: DMGAssistAPI."] = "在暴雪的编辑模式中移动 HUD。Masque 可美化图标。使用手柄时，按键显示为手柄按钮（显示 > 手柄按键名称）。插件作者：DMGAssistAPI。",
  ["DMGAssist works with these when they are installed, with nothing to set up: Masque skins its icons, boss mods time defensives and interrupts, WeakAuras can read its picks."] = "安装后 DMGAssist 会自动配合这些插件，无需设置：Masque 为图标换肤，首领插件为防御和打断提供时机，WeakAuras 可以读取推荐。",
  ["Accuracy"] = "准确度",
  ["After each real fight, a grade from S+ to D pops up above the icons, with four parts: accuracy, always casting, reaction and cooldowns."] = "每场真实战斗结束后，图标上方会弹出 S+ 到 D 的评级，包含四项：准确度、持续施法、反应速度和冷却使用。",
  ["Always casting"] = "持续施法",
  ["Average of the last %d"] = "最近 %d 场平均",
  ["Best"] = "最佳",
  ["Best grade, trend and where to improve for the spec you are in: see Grade report below Performance grade."] = "当前专精的最佳评级、趋势和改进方向：见“表现评级”下的“评级报告”。",
  ["Clears the best grade and history of the spec you are in. Other specs keep theirs."] = "清除当前专精的最佳评级和记录。其他专精保留各自的记录。",
  ["Cooldowns"] = "冷却使用",
  ["Drag the grade where you want it while the icons are unlocked or in Edit Mode; a sample shows while you do."] = "在图标解锁或编辑模式下，把评级拖到你想要的位置；拖动时会显示示例。",
  ["End-of-fight grade"] = "战斗结束评级",
  ["Fight grade"] = "战斗评级",
  ["Fights shorter than this aren't graded, so trash pulls and a quick hit on a critter don't count."] = "短于此时长的战斗不评级，清小怪或随手打一下小动物都不算。",
  ["Forget every spec's grades"] = "清除所有专精的评级",
  ["Forget this spec's grades"] = "清除此专精的评级",
  ["Grade report"] = "评级报告",
  ["Grade stays on screen"] = "评级显示时长",
  ["Grades every fight that lasts long enough: how often you pressed what slot 1 showed, how little time slot 1 sat ready, how fast you pressed it, and how quickly cooldowns were used. It never measures damage. Off: nothing is tracked or shown."] = "为每场足够长的战斗评级：你按下 1 号位所示技能的频率、1 号位就绪却闲置的时间有多短、你按得有多快、冷却技能用得有多及时。从不衡量伤害。关闭：不记录也不显示。",
  ["Grades for this spec forgotten."] = "已清除此专精的评级。",
  ["How long the grade stays before it fades out. It pops in quickly and fades in under a second."] = "评级淡出前停留的时长。它会快速弹出，并在一秒内淡出。",
  ["How your fights went in the spec you are in. Only fights long enough to grade count."] = "你当前专精的战斗表现。只计入足够长的战斗。",
  ["Last %d fights (newest last)"] = "最近 %d 场战斗（最新在后）",
  ["Moves the grade back to its default place, just above the three icons."] = "把评级移回默认位置，即三个图标正上方。",
  ["New best!"] = "新纪录！",
  ["No graded fights yet for this spec. Fight something for 20 seconds or more."] = "此专精还没有评级的战斗。战斗 20 秒或更久即可。",
  ["Nothing to improve: keep it up."] = "无需改进：保持下去。",
  ["Performance grade"] = "表现评级",
  ["Pops up a sample grade the way a real one shows, to check its place and how long it stays."] = "像真实评级一样弹出示例评级，以检查位置和停留时长。",
  ["Put the grade back above the icons"] = "把评级放回图标上方",
  ["Reaction"] = "反应速度",
  ["Reset"] = "重置",
  ["Shortest fight to grade"] = "最短评级战斗时长",
  ["Show a sample grade"] = "显示示例评级",
  ["Show the grade after fights"] = "战斗后显示评级",
  ["Tip: press as the flash comes, or a little before: the game queues a press made just before it's ready."] = "提示：在闪光出现时或稍早按下：游戏会把就绪前片刻的按键排入队列。",
  ["Tip: press what slot 1 shows; slots 2 and 3 are what comes after it."] = "提示：按 1 号位显示的技能；2 号和 3 号位是之后的技能。",
  ["Tip: slot 1 asked for %s %d times when you pressed something else."] = "提示：你按了别的技能时，1 号位要求 %s 共 %d 次。",
  ["Tip: slot 1 was ready for %.1f s without a press. Keep the global cooldown rolling."] = "提示：1 号位就绪了 %.1f 秒却没有按下。保持公共冷却不停转。",
  ["Tip: use major cooldowns, trinkets and your potion as soon as they show."] = "提示：主要冷却、饰品和药水一出现就使用。",
  ["Trend"] = "趋势",
  ["Where to improve"] = "改进方向",
  ["Your results"] = "你的成绩",
  ["improving"] = "上升",
  ["slipping"] = "下滑",
  ["steady"] = "稳定",
  ["Sample grade"] = "示例评级",
  ["Default place"] = "默认位置",
  ["This spec's history"] = "此专精的记录",
  ["Left of slot 1, top"] = "1 号位左侧，上方",
  ["Left of slot 1, bottom"] = "1 号位左侧，下方",
  ["For tank specs, slots 1-3 stay your damage rotation and your mitigation shows in the defensive icon, timed to how your spec tanks."] = "坦克专精的 1-3 号位保持伤害循环，减伤技能显示在防御图标中，按你的专精坦克方式安排时机。",
  ["For the tank spec you are in: at or below this much health your emergency button (Last Stand, Frenzied Regeneration, Vampiric Blood...) shows. Saved per spec."] = "当前坦克专精：生命值等于或低于此值时显示紧急按钮（破釜沉舟、狂暴回复、吸血鬼之血……）。按专精保存。",
  ["Mitigation"] = "减伤",
  ["Tank low health"] = "坦克低生命值",
  ["Tank mitigation in the defensive icon"] = "在防御图标中显示坦克减伤",
  ["Tanks"] = "坦克",
  ["Tip: press your mitigation (the red icon) as soon as it shows; it's timed to keep you safe."] = "提示：减伤（红色图标）一出现就按；它的时机是为了保护你。",
  ["While you hold aggro, the defensive icon shows your keep-up buttons when they're due (Shield Block, Demon Spikes, Shield of the Righteous...), cooldowns before big hits your boss mod warns about, and Spell Reflection or Anti-Magic Shell for spells cast at you. Off: SimC's list decides, as for other specs."] = "你持有仇恨时，防御图标会在需要时显示维持类按钮（盾牌格挡、恶魔尖刺、正义盾击……），在首领插件预警的重击前显示冷却技能，并在有法术针对你时显示法术反射或反魔法护罩。关闭：与其他专精一样由 SimC 列表决定。",
  ["%s (several targets)"] = "%s（多目标）",
  ["%s: left to Blizzard's assistant (its cooldown moves with effects we can't see)"] = "%s：交给暴雪助手（其冷却会受我们看不到的效果影响）",
  ["%s: measured %d times, our clock corrected by %+.1f s, now within %.1f s"] = "%s：测量 %d 次，时钟修正 %+.1f 秒，现在误差 %.1f 秒",
  ["Nothing yet: it learns from your fights."] = "暂无：它会从你的战斗中学习。",
  ["What DMGAssist learned for this spec"] = "DMGAssist 为此专精学到的内容",
  ["One line of advice on your weakest part, worded differently from fight to fight. Off: the grade and its parts only."] = "关于你最弱一项的一句建议，每场战斗换种说法。关闭：只显示评级和各项。",
  ["Show a tip under the grade"] = "在评级下显示提示",
  ["Tip: %s came up in slot 1 %d times and something else got pressed. Give it the priority."] = "提示：%s 在 1 号位出现了 %d 次，却按了别的。优先按它。",
  ["Tip: watch for %s - slot 1 wanted it %d times this fight."] = "提示：留意 %s——这场战斗中 1 号位要求了它 %d 次。",
  ["Tip: slot 1 is always the next press. Slots 2 and 3 are a preview, not a choice."] = "提示：1 号位永远是下一个要按的。2 号和 3 号位是预览，不是选项。",
  ["Tip: follow slot 1 in order; the priority already accounts for your procs and cooldowns."] = "提示：按顺序跟着 1 号位；优先级已考虑你的触发效果和冷却。",
  ["Tip: if two spells look good, trust slot 1 - it's the one that does the most right now."] = "提示：两个技能看起来都不错时，相信 1 号位——它是当下收益最高的。",
  ["Tip: %.1f s went by with a spell ready and nothing pressed. Something to press is almost always there."] = "提示：有技能就绪却 %.1f 秒没有按键。几乎总有可以按的。",
  ["Tip: you lost %.1f s of casting this fight. Press the next spell as the last one finishes."] = "提示：这场战斗你损失了 %.1f 秒施法时间。上一个技能结束时就按下一个。",
  ["Tip: keep a button going at all times; even a filler beats waiting."] = "提示：始终保持有键在按；即使是填充技能也比等待好。",
  ["Tip: when you have to move, use instant spells so the casting doesn't stop."] = "提示：需要移动时，用瞬发技能保持施法不断。",
  ["Tip: you can press a moment before slot 1 is ready; the game queues it for you."] = "提示：你可以在 1 号位就绪前一瞬按下；游戏会替你排队。",
  ["Tip: watch the sweep on slot 1 and press as it closes, not after."] = "提示：看着 1 号位的转圈，在它合上时按，而不是之后。",
  ["Tip: a key close to your hand makes slot 1 quicker to press."] = "提示：把键放在手边，按 1 号位会更快。",
  ["Tip: react to the flash on slot 1; every small pause adds up over a fight."] = "提示：对 1 号位的闪光做出反应；每个小停顿在整场战斗中都会累积。",
  ["Tip: a cooldown sitting ready is damage lost. Press it when slot 1 shows it."] = "提示：就绪却闲置的冷却就是损失的伤害。1 号位显示时就按。",
  ["Tip: cooldowns come back sooner the sooner you use them."] = "提示：冷却越早用，越早回来。",
  ["Tip: bind your cooldowns where you can reach them in a hurry."] = "提示：把冷却技能放在急用时能立刻按到的地方。",
  ["Tip: when slot 1 shows a cooldown it's already lined up with your other buffs: press it."] = "提示：1 号位显示冷却时，它已经与你的其他增益对齐：按下去。",
  ["Tip: keep your mitigation rolling: press the red icon as it lights up, before the hits land."] = "提示：保持减伤：红色图标一亮就按，在重击到来之前。",
  ["Tip: tanking is timing. The red icon shows your mitigation exactly when it's due."] = "提示：坦克靠时机。红色图标恰好在需要时显示你的减伤。",
  ["Tip: late mitigation means a big hit taken. Keep an eye on the red icon."] = "提示：减伤晚了就会吃到重击。留意红色图标。",
  ["Nothing to improve: that was clean."] = "无需改进：干净利落。",
  ["Great fight: every part was on point."] = "精彩的战斗：每一项都很到位。",
  ["Nothing to fix this time. Try it on a harder target."] = "这次没什么要改的。试试更难的目标。",
  ["Settings: press Esc, choose Options, then the AddOns tab > DMGAssist."] = "设置：按 Esc，选择“选项”，再进入“插件”标签 > DMGAssist。",
  ["Accuracy, Always casting, Reaction and Cooldowns (and Mitigation for tanks) under the bar."] = "在条下显示准确度、持续施法、反应速度和冷却使用（坦克还有减伤）。",
  ["Grade size"] = "评级大小",
  ["How see-through the box behind the grade is. 0% = no box at all, only the letters and numbers."] = "评级背后框的透明度。0% = 没有框，只有字母和数字。",
  ["Makes the whole grade bigger or smaller."] = "放大或缩小整个评级。",
  ["Outlines the real action button for slot 1's spell on your bars (Blizzard's, Bartender, ElvUI, Dominos) in DMGAssist's magenta, so it never looks like Blizzard's own gold or blue highlights."] = "用 DMGAssist 的品红色描边你动作条上（暴雪、Bartender、ElvUI、Dominos）1 号位技能的实际按钮，避免与暴雪自带的金色或蓝色高亮混淆。",
  ["Show the grade bar"] = "显示评级条",
  ["Show the parts"] = "显示各项",
  ["The coloured D-to-S+ bar with a marker that slides to your score."] = "从 D 到 S+ 的彩色条，标记会滑到你的分数。",
  ["%d extras"] = "额外 %d 次",
  ["Beyond Assisted Combat: %d%% of the fight"] = "超越辅助战斗：战斗的 %d%%",
  ["How much of the fight slot 1 showed something other than Blizzard's Assisted Combat, and why: cooldowns timed by SimC, a different core spell (SimC's priority), DoTs and buffs kept up, utility (interrupts, defensives, gap closers), plus extras Blizzard never shows (the off-GCD badge, trinkets). It shows where DMGAssist plays differently, not damage: addons can't read damage done."] = "战斗中 1 号位显示与暴雪辅助战斗不同内容的比例及原因：由 SimC 把握时机的冷却技能、不同的核心法术（SimC 的优先级）、保持的持续伤害和增益、辅助（打断、防御、突进），以及暴雪从不显示的额外项（不占公共冷却的图标、饰品）。它显示 DMGAssist 打法不同之处，而非伤害：插件无法读取造成的伤害。",
  ["Show Beyond Assisted Combat"] = "显示“超越辅助战斗”",
  ["cooldowns %d%%"] = "冷却 %d%%",
  ["rotation %d%%"] = "循环 %d%%",
  ["upkeep %d%%"] = "维持 %d%%",
  ["utility %d%%"] = "辅助 %d%%",
  ["GO"] = "出手",
  ["HOLD"] = "等待",
  ["HOLD during channels"] = "引导期间显示等待",
  ["While one of your channeled spells runs (Spinning Crane Kick, Fists of Fury, Mind Flay...), slot 1 shows an amber HOLD: pressing anything now would cut it short. A green GO shows the moment it ends. Channels your spec's priority list cuts short on purpose get no HOLD."] = "当你的引导法术进行中（神鹤引项踢、怒雷破、精神鞭笞等），1 号位显示琥珀色的“等待”：此时按任何键都会打断它。结束的那一刻会显示绿色的“出手”。你的专精优先级列表有意打断的引导不会显示“等待”。",
  ["While one of your channeled spells runs (Spinning Crane Kick, Fists of Fury, Mind Flay...), slot 1 shows an amber HOLD: pressing anything now would cut it short. Its border flashes green the moment it ends."] = "当你的引导法术进行中（神鹤引项踢、怒雷破、精神鞭笞等），1 号位显示琥珀色的“等待”：此时按任何键都会打断它。结束的那一刻边框会闪绿光。",
  ["Atonements kept up"] = "保持的救赎数",
  ["Discipline Priest and Mistweaver Monk: healing that comes from your rotation, while you deal damage."] = "戒律牧师和织雾武僧：你打伤害时，来自循环的治疗。",
  ["Healers in groups"] = "小队中的治疗者",
  ["Healing support"] = "治疗支援",
  ["Hunter's Mark on bosses"] = "首领身上的猎人印记",
  ["Hunters: with a boss targeted (before the pull too), Hunter's Mark comes first in slot 1 until it is on it."] = "猎人：目标是首领时（开怪前也算），猎人印记排在第 1 格，直到印记挂上。",
  ["In a party or raid: Discipline keeps Atonement up all the time (Shield, or Radiance when several are missing); Mistweaver casts Renewing Mist whenever a charge is ready. Solo, nothing changes."] = "在小队或团队中：戒律始终保持救赎（盾，缺几个时用耀）；织雾只要有一层充能就施放复苏之雾。单人时不变。",
  ["With healing support: this many Atonements, counted from your casts, between big hits."] = "开启治疗支援时：在大伤害之间保持这么多救赎（按你的施法计数）。",
  ["%s is in slot 1 but isn't on your action bars. Drag it from the spellbook (hero talent spells are on a later page) onto a bar and give it a key, or hide it on the Spells & trinkets page."] = "%s 在第 1 格，但不在你的动作条上。从法术书（英雄天赋法术在后面的页面）拖到动作条上并绑定按键，或在“法术和饰品”页面隐藏它。",
  ["%s is in slot 1 but its button has no key. Bind one (Options > Keybindings) or press it from your bar."] = "%s 在第 1 格，但它的按钮没有按键。绑定一个（选项 > 按键设置），或从动作条上点击。",
  ["Fights less than 10 seconds apart (questing, mob to mob) are graded together: one grade 10 seconds after the last, or every 3 minutes on a long run, instead of one after every mob. Short fights add up, so they get graded too. Bosses are graded at once."] = "间隔不到 10 秒的战斗（做任务、一个接一个打怪）会合并评分：在最后一场结束 10 秒后评一次分，长时间连续战斗则每 3 分钟评一次，而不是每个怪评一次。短战斗会累加，因此也能获得评分。首领战立即评分。",
  ["Group quick fights"] = "合并短战斗",
  ["%s is shown in a small icon (defensive or off-GCD) but has no key. Put it on a bar and give it a key, or hide it on the Spells & trinkets page."] = "%s 显示在小图标中（减伤或不占公共冷却），但没有按键。把它放到动作条上并绑定按键，或在“法术和饰品”页面隐藏它。",
  ["%s is in your rotation but isn't on your action bars, so DMGAssist skips it. Drag it from the spellbook onto a bar (and give it a key) to have it suggested."] = "%s 在你的循环中，但不在你的动作条上，因此 DMGAssist 会跳过它。把它从法术书拖到动作条上（并绑定按键）即可被推荐。",
  ["Only spells on your bars"] = "只推荐动作条上的技能",
  ["A spell that isn't on any of your action bars is never suggested: the next one takes its place, and chat says which spell once. Off: every spell you know can be suggested."] = "不在任何动作条上的技能永远不会被推荐：由下一个技能替代，聊天框会提示一次是哪个技能。关闭：你会的所有技能都可能被推荐。",
  ["%s is missing (Blizzard's assistant asks for it), so DMGAssist shows it until you apply it. Ignore it and it goes away for the rest of the fight."] = "缺少%s（暴雪助手要求使用），DMGAssist会一直显示直到你施放。忽略它，本场战斗剩余时间内将不再显示。",
  ["Suggest a defensive at least this long before a big hit that a boss mod announces. Defensives that last longer show earlier, so you have time to press it and the hit lands well inside it."] = "在首领插件预告的大伤害前至少这么久建议使用减伤技能。持续时间更长的减伤会更早显示，让你有时间按下，并且伤害稳稳落在其持续时间内。",
  ["Wrong-key hint"] = "按错键提示",
  ["When you press the key right next to the one slot 1 showed (5 instead of 6), or forget its Shift / Ctrl / Alt, slot 1 shows both keys for a moment, like \"5 » 6\". A slip that keeps happening becomes the fight's tip."] = "当你按了1号位所示按键旁边的键（按了5而不是6），或漏按 Shift / Ctrl / Alt 时，1号位会短暂显示两个按键，例如“5 » 6”。反复出现的误按会成为本场战斗的提示。",
  ["Tip: you pressed %s %d times when slot 1 showed %s (%s). If that key is hard to reach, move the spell to one that's easier to hit."] = "提示：你按了 %s 共 %d 次，而1号位显示的是 %s（%s）。如果这个键不好按，把该技能移到更顺手的键上。",
  ["Game mode"] = "游戏模式",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game: notes slide right to left into a line on the left and reach it when the spell can be pressed. Top lane: damage. Middle: defensives and heals. Bottom: trinkets and potions. Hits build a streak; 5, 10, 25, 50 in a row earn a star. Switch any time with the drum button on the HUD or /dmga game."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩：音符从右向左滑向左侧的判定线，到达判定线时正好可以按下该技能。上轨：伤害。中轨：减伤和治疗。下轨：饰品和药水。命中会累积连击；连续5、10、25、50次各得一颗星。随时可用HUD上的鼓按钮或 /dmga game 切换。",
  ["Game mode: on (click for the classic HUD)"] = "游戏模式：开启（点击切回经典HUD）",
  ["Game mode: off (click to play it as a game)"] = "游戏模式：关闭（点击以游戏方式进行）",
  ["Streak %d"] = "连击 %d",
  ["Best %d"] = "最佳 %d",
  ["Game mode on: hit each note as it reaches the line. Click the drum (or /dmga game) to switch back."] = "游戏模式已开启：音符到达判定线时按下。点击鼓按钮（或 /dmga game）可切换回来。",
  ["Game mode off: the classic HUD is back."] = "游戏模式已关闭：经典HUD已恢复。",
  ["Which style? (Switch any time with the drum button on the HUD, or /dmga game.)"] = "选择哪种风格？（随时可用HUD上的鼓按钮或 /dmga game 切换。）",
  ["Classic: the next three spells as icons"] = "经典：以图标显示接下来的三个技能",
  ["Game mode: notes slide into a hit line, with streaks"] = "游戏模式：音符滑向判定线，带连击",
  ["Switch Game mode on / off"] = "开启 / 关闭游戏模式",
  ["Game mode on / off: notes slide into a hit line, streaks and stars"] = "游戏模式开 / 关：音符滑向判定线，连击和星星",
  ["the setup questions again (where, how big, when to show, which style)"] = "再次回答设置问题（位置、大小、何时显示、哪种风格）",
  ["Nice!"] = "不错！",
  ["Great!"] = "很棒！",
  ["Awesome!"] = "太强了！",
  ["On fire!"] = "火力全开！",
  ["Unstoppable!"] = "势不可挡！",
  ["Legendary!"] = "传奇！",
  ["Perfect!"] = "完美！",
  ["Great"] = "很棒",
  ["Good"] = "不错",
  ["Miss"] = "未命中",
  ["Score %d"] = "得分 %d",
  ["Bronze"] = "青铜",
  ["Silver"] = "白银",
  ["Gold"] = "黄金",
  ["Platinum"] = "白金",
  ["Diamond"] = "钻石",
  ["Mythic"] = "神话",
  ["PERFECT!"] = "完美！",
  ["Spot on!"] = "正中！",
  ["Bullseye!"] = "命中靶心！",
  ["Flawless!"] = "无懈可击！",
  ["Right on the beat!"] = "完全踩点！",
  ["Nice timing!"] = "时机不错！",
  ["Sharp!"] = "漂亮！",
  ["Excellent!"] = "优秀！",
  ["Well played!"] = "打得好！",
  ["Not bad"] = "还不错",
  ["Almost!"] = "差一点！",
  ["Keep it up"] = "继续保持",
  ["Nice try"] = "不错的尝试",
  ["Oh, too bad..."] = "哎呀，可惜……",
  ["Missed!"] = "没中！",
  ["So close..."] = "就差一点……",
  ["Shake it off"] = "别在意",
  ["Next one!"] = "下一个！",
  ["Great streak!"] = "漂亮的连击！",
  ["Keep it up!"] = "继续保持！",
  ["Blazing!"] = "炽热！",
  ["Streak Champion!"] = "连击冠军！",
  ["Godlike!"] = "神一般！",
  ["Immortal!"] = "不朽！",
  ["Game timing offset"] = "游戏模式时间偏移",
  ["Game mode: moves the moment a note reaches the line (and flashes). If your presses feel late, raise it: the note arrives that much sooner. Like a rhythm game's calibration."] = "游戏模式：调整音符到达判定线（并闪光）的时刻。如果你总觉得按晚了，就调高它：音符会提前相应时间到达。就像节奏游戏的校准。",
  ["Game score %d, best streak %d, %d%% perfect"] = "游戏得分 %d，最佳连击 %d，完美 %d%%",
  ["(new high score)"] = "（新纪录）",
  ["Clears the best streak and best set score of the spec you are in. Other specs keep theirs."] = "清除当前专精的最佳连击和最佳一轮得分。其他专精保留各自的记录。",
  ["Core"] = "核心",
  ["Core settings"] = "核心设置",
  ["Describe what went wrong, copy the report, and open the issue page (also /dmga report)."] = "描述出了什么问题，复制报告并打开问题页面（也可用 /dmga report）。",
  ["Forget this spec's game records"] = "清除此专精的游戏记录",
  ["Four questions: where the HUD goes, how big, when it shows, and classic or Game mode."] = "四个问题：HUD放在哪里、多大、何时显示，以及经典还是游戏模式。",
  ["Game mode & grades"] = "游戏模式与评分",
  ["Game records for this spec forgotten."] = "已清除此专精的游戏记录。",
  ["How DMGAssist thinks and looks: Combat, Display, Sounds, Integrations, Spells & trinkets and Advanced, on the pages below."] = "DMGAssist如何判断和显示：战斗、显示、声音、集成、技能与饰品、高级，见下方页面。",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game, or keep the classic icons. Switch any time with the drum button on the HUD, /dmga game, or a key binding."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩，或保留经典图标。随时可用HUD上的鼓按钮、/dmga game 或按键绑定切换。",
  ["Records"] = "记录",
  ["Report"] = "报告",
  ["Status & Help"] = "状态与帮助",
  ["Turn DMGAssist on or off, move it, and pick its language. Everything else is in three groups below: Status & Help, Core (Combat, Display, Sounds, Integrations, Advanced) and Game mode & grades."] = "开启或关闭DMGAssist、移动它并选择语言。其余内容分为下方三组：状态与帮助、核心（战斗、显示、声音、集成、高级）以及游戏模式与评分。",
  ["What DMGAssist sees right now (Status), how to use it (Help), and spells it may recommend that have no key yet (Missing keybinds): the pages below."] = "DMGAssist当前看到的内容（状态）、使用方法（帮助），以及可能推荐但没有按键的技能（缺少按键绑定）：见下方页面。",
  ["KICK!"] = "打断！",
  ["DEFEND!"] = "防御！",
  ["POWER UP!"] = "强化！",
  ["Interrupted!"] = "打断成功！",
  ["Safe!"] = "安全！",
  ["Powered up!"] = "已强化！",
  ["Bonus +%d"] = "奖励 +%d",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game: notes slide right to left into a line and reach it when the spell can be pressed. Interrupts, defensives and trinkets pop into the bonus row above it. Hits build a streak; 5, 10, 25, 50 in a row earn a star. Switch any time with the drum button on the HUD or /dmga game."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩：音符从右向左滑向判定线，到达时正好可以按下该技能。打断、减伤和饰品会出现在上方的奖励行。命中会累积连击；连续5、10、25、50次各得一颗星。随时可用HUD上的鼓按钮或 /dmga game 切换。",
  ["POWER MODE!"] = "力量模式！",
  ["AOE"] = "群体",
  ["PERFECT x%d"] = "完美 x%d",
  ["CLASSIC"] = "经典",
  ["GAME"] = "游戏",
  ["Game mode on: hit each note as it reaches the line. Click the CLASSIC / GAME switch (or /dmga game) to switch back."] = "游戏模式已开启：音符到达判定线时按下。点击 经典 / 游戏 开关（或 /dmga game）可切换回来。",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game, or keep the classic icons. Switch any time with the CLASSIC / GAME switch above the HUD, /dmga game, or a key binding."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩，或保留经典图标。随时可用HUD上方的 经典 / 游戏 开关、/dmga game 或按键绑定切换。",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game: notes slide right to left into a line and reach it when the spell can be pressed. Interrupts, defensives and trinkets pop into the bonus row above it. Hits build a streak; 5, 10, 25, 50 in a row earn a star. Switch any time with the CLASSIC / GAME switch above the HUD or /dmga game."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩：音符从右向左滑向判定线，到达时正好可以按下该技能。打断、减伤和饰品会出现在上方的奖励行。命中会累积连击；连续5、10、25、50次各得一颗星。随时可用HUD上方的 经典 / 游戏 开关或 /dmga game 切换。",
  ["Which style? (Switch any time with the CLASSIC / GAME switch above the HUD, or /dmga game.)"] = "选择哪种风格？（随时可用HUD上方的 经典 / 游戏 开关或 /dmga game 切换。）",
  ["FLOW"] = "FLOW",
  ["Flow mode"] = "Flow模式",
  ["Flow mode & grades"] = "Flow模式与评分",
  ["Flow mode off: the classic HUD is back."] = "Flow模式已关闭：经典HUD已恢复。",
  ["Flow mode on: hit each note as it reaches the line. Click the CLASSIC / FLOW switch (or /dmga flow) to switch back."] = "Flow模式已开启：音符到达判定线时按下。点击 经典 / FLOW 开关（或 /dmga flow）可切换回来。",
  ["Flow mode: moves the moment a note reaches the line (and flashes). If your presses feel late, raise it: the note arrives that much sooner. Like a rhythm game's calibration."] = "Flow模式：调整音符到达判定线（并闪光）的时刻。如果你总觉得按晚了，就调高它：音符会提前相应时间到达。就像节奏游戏的校准。",
  ["Flow mode: notes slide into a hit line, with streaks"] = "Flow模式：音符滑向判定线，带连击",
  ["Flow mode: off (click to play the HUD like a rhythm game)"] = "Flow模式：关闭（点击把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩）",
  ["Flow mode: on (click for the classic HUD)"] = "Flow模式：开启（点击切回经典HUD）",
  ["Flow records for this spec forgotten."] = "已清除此专精的Flow记录。",
  ["Flow score %d, best streak %d, %d%% perfect"] = "Flow得分 %d，最佳连击 %d，完美 %d%%",
  ["Flow timing offset"] = "Flow模式时间偏移",
  ["Forget this spec's Flow records"] = "清除此专精的Flow记录",
  ["Four questions: where the HUD goes, how big, when it shows, and classic or Flow mode."] = "四个问题：HUD放在哪里、多大、何时显示，以及经典还是Flow模式。",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game, or keep the classic icons. Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch above the HUD, /dmga flow, or a key binding."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩，或保留经典图标。随时可用HUD上方的 经典 / FLOW 开关、/dmga flow 或按键绑定切换。",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game: notes slide right to left into a line and reach it when the spell can be pressed. Interrupts, defensives and trinkets pop into the bonus row above it. Hits build a streak; 5, 10, 25, 50 in a row earn a star. Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch above the HUD or /dmga flow."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩：音符从右向左滑向判定线，到达时正好可以按下该技能。打断、减伤和饰品会出现在上方的奖励行。命中会累积连击；连续5、10、25、50次各得一颗星。随时可用HUD上方的 经典 / FLOW 开关或 /dmga flow 切换。",
  ["Turn DMGAssist on or off, move it, and pick its language. Everything else is in three groups below: Status & Help, Core (Combat, Display, Sounds, Integrations, Advanced) and Flow mode & grades."] = "开启或关闭DMGAssist、移动它并选择语言。其余内容分为下方三组：状态与帮助、核心（战斗、显示、声音、集成、高级）以及Flow模式与评分。",
  ["Which style? (Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch above the HUD, or /dmga flow.)"] = "选择哪种风格？（随时可用HUD上方的 经典 / FLOW 开关或 /dmga flow 切换。）",
  ["Switch Flow mode on / off"] = "开启 / 关闭Flow模式",
  ["Flow mode on / off: notes slide into a hit line, streaks and stars"] = "Flow模式开 / 关：音符滑向判定线，连击和星星",
  ["READY, PLAYER ONE?"] = "准备好了吗，玩家一？",
  ["INSERT COIN"] = "请投币",
  ["PRESS START"] = "按下开始",
  ["Hit your first spell to start the Flow"] = "施放第一个技能即可开始Flow",
  ["LET'S GO!"] = "开始吧！",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game, or keep the classic icons. Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch under the HUD, /dmga flow, or a key binding."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩，或保留经典图标。随时可用HUD下方的 经典 / FLOW 开关、/dmga flow 或按键绑定切换。",
  ["Play the HUD like a rhythm game: notes slide right to left into a line and reach it when the spell can be pressed. Interrupts, defensives and trinkets pop into the bonus row above it. Hits build a streak; 5, 10, 25, 50 in a row earn a star. Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch under the HUD or /dmga flow."] = "把HUD当作节奏游戏来玩：音符从右向左滑向判定线，到达时正好可以按下该技能。打断、减伤和饰品会出现在上方的奖励行。命中会累积连击；连续5、10、25、50次各得一颗星。随时可用HUD下方的 经典 / FLOW 开关或 /dmga flow 切换。",
  ["Which style? (Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch under the HUD, or /dmga flow.)"] = "选择哪种风格？（随时可用HUD下方的 经典 / FLOW 开关或 /dmga flow 切换。）",
  ["PAUSED"] = "已暂停",
  ["Hit your next spell to jump back in"] = "施放下一个技能即可继续",
  ["Back in the Flow!"] = "回到Flow！",
  ["This spec's shots need a bow, gun or crossbow equipped: with your current weapon they can't be used, so DMGAssist has nothing to show."] = "该专精的射击需要装备弓、枪或弩：当前武器无法使用这些技能，因此 DMGAssist 没有可显示的内容。",
  ["INTERRUPT!"] = "打断！",
  ["Pick your style"] = "选择你的风格",
  ["Your next three spells as icons. Press the big one."] = "以图标显示接下来的三个技能。按下最大的那个。",
  ["Spells slide into the box. Press each one as it lands and build a streak."] = "技能滑入方框。每个技能到达时按下，累积连击。",
  ["Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch under the HUD."] = "随时可用 HUD 下方的 CLASSIC / FLOW 开关切换。",
  ["%s is in slot 1 but isn't on your action bars. Drag it from the spellbook (hero talent spells are on a later page) onto a bar and give it a key, or hide it on the Spells, trinkets & potion page."] = "%s 在第 1 格，但不在你的动作条上。从法术书（英雄天赋法术在后面的页面）拖到动作条上并绑定按键，或在“法术和饰品”页面隐藏它。",
  ["%s is shown in a small icon (defensive or off-GCD) but has no key. Put it on a bar and give it a key, or hide it on the Spells, trinkets & potion page."] = "%s 显示在小图标中（减伤或不占公共冷却），但没有按键。把它放到动作条上并绑定按键，或在“法术和饰品”页面隐藏它。",
  ["%s. Suggested in the items badge beside slot 1 when SimC drinks a potion (with your big cooldowns). Click the box to change it, right-click to remove it."] = "%s。当 SimC 使用药水时（配合你的大技能），会在 1 号位旁的物品徽章中提示。点击方框更换，右键移除。",
  ["A tag in an icon's corner says where the pick came from: none = SimulationCraft's priority list, AC = Blizzard's Assisted Combat, B = Blizzard's written rules, ? = a best guess (also dimmed), ... = waiting for resource, BUFF = a buff to put back up before the pull. Badges at the big icon's corners: red edge = a spell to press alongside it, off the global cooldown (Ironfur, Shield Block) or a defensive; gold edge = an on-use trinket or your potion. A red-edged icon beside the HUD: interrupt now. Red text above the HUD: a warning from your boss mod."] = "图标角落的标签表示来源：无 = SimulationCraft 优先级列表，AC = 暴雪的辅助战斗，B = 暴雪编写的规则，? = 最佳猜测（也会变暗），... = 等待资源，BUFF = 开怪前需要补上的增益。大图标角落的徽章：红边 = 一同按下的技能，不占公共冷却（铁鬃、盾牌格挡）或防御技能；金边 = 可使用饰品或你的药水。HUD 旁的红边图标：立刻打断。HUD 上方的红字：首领插件的警告。",
  ["After a set of pulls, a grade from S+ to D in both modes: pressing the spell shown (accuracy), never sitting idle while it's ready (always be casting), how quickly you press it (reaction) and how soon you use big cooldowns, trinkets and potions. It never claims damage: the game's damage meter shows that. Flow mode & grades > Grade report has your best, your recent sets and where to improve."] = "一组战斗后，两种模式都会给出 S+ 到 D 的评分：按显示的技能（准确度）、技能就绪时不空闲（持续施法）、按下的速度（反应）以及多快使用大技能、饰品和药水。它从不评判伤害：游戏的伤害统计会显示。Flow模式与评分 > 评分报告里有你的最佳成绩、近期战斗组和改进方向。",
  ["Big icon (NOW): press it. A dark shade over it counts down until it can be pressed, then it flashes. Small icons (NEXT): what comes after it. Gold bar under the icons: your global cooldown. Title row: the target mode and how many enemies are counted (AUTO · AOE 3 targets). Red icon: your target is out of that spell's range. Blue big icon: not enough resource yet. HOLD over the big icon: you are channeling, let it finish. \"5 » 6\" under it: you pressed 5, the big icon wanted 6."] = "大图标（现在）：按它。深色遮罩会倒计时到可以按下，然后闪光。小图标（下一个）：接下来的技能。图标下方的金色条：公共冷却。标题行：目标模式和计数的敌人数量（AUTO · AOE 3 个目标）。红色图标：目标超出该技能距离。蓝色大图标：资源还不够。大图标上的 HOLD：你正在引导，让它读完。下方的“5 » 6”：你按了 5，大图标要的是 6。",
  ["Boss mods, Masque, bar addons and the tests for them."] = "首领插件、Masque、动作条插件及其测试。",
  ["Classic: tags and badges"] = "经典：标签和徽章",
  ["Classic: what you see"] = "经典：界面说明",
  ["Combat, Display, Sounds, Integrations, Advanced, and your spells, trinkets and potion."] = "战斗、显示、声音、集成、高级，以及你的技能、饰品和药水。",
  ["Core is a group: its settings are on the pages inside it. Click the + beside Core on the left to see them, or open one here."] = "核心是一个分组：设置在其中的子页面里。点击左侧“核心”旁的 + 查看，或在这里直接打开。",
  ["Custom: how big the icons are and the space between them. To move them, unlock on the first page and drag, or use Blizzard's Edit Mode."] = "自定义：图标大小及间距。要移动它们，在第一页解锁后拖动，或使用暴雪的编辑模式。",
  ["DMGAssist shows your rotation in two ways, and both always agree on the spell to press now. CLASSIC: three icons; the big one is the spell to press, the two small ones come after it. FLOW: the same spells slide along a lane into a box like a rhythm game; press each one as it lands to build a streak and a score. Switch any time with the CLASSIC / FLOW switch under the HUD, /dmga flow, or the minimap menu."] = "DMGAssist 用两种方式显示你的循环，两者对“现在该按什么”永远一致。经典：三个图标；大的是现在要按的技能，两个小的是接下来的。FLOW：同样的技能像节奏游戏一样沿轨道滑入方框；在它到达时按下，累积连击和分数。随时可以用 HUD 下方的 经典 / FLOW 开关、/dmga flow 或小地图菜单切换。",
  ["Equipped trinkets you can use. Ticked: shown in the items badge beside slot 1 when SimC uses it (with your big cooldowns). Unticked: never shown."] = "已装备的可使用饰品。勾选：当 SimC 使用它时（配合你的大技能），在 1 号位旁的物品徽章中显示。不勾选：从不显示。",
  ["Every equipped on-use trinket and every spell can be switched off on the Spells, trinkets & potion page."] = "每个已装备的主动饰品和每个技能都可以在“技能、饰品和药水”页面关闭。",
  ["Everything else is in three groups, each with pages inside: click the + beside DMGAssist on the left to see them, or open one here."] = "其他设置分在三个分组里，每组都有子页面：点击左侧 DMGAssist 旁的 + 查看，或在这里直接打开。",
  ["Flow mode & grades has more pages inside it: click the + beside it on the left, or open one here."] = "Flow模式与评分里还有子页面：点击左侧旁边的 + 查看，或在这里直接打开。",
  ["Flow: notes, bars and colours"] = "Flow：音符、长条和颜色",
  ["Flow: what you see"] = "Flow：界面说明",
  ["For %s. What DMGAssist may show you, in three parts: the potion it suggests with your big cooldowns, your on-use trinkets, and your spells. Kept per spec (trinkets per item), through updates and gear swaps."] = "%s。DMGAssist 可以显示的内容分三部分：配合大技能使用的药水、可使用的饰品，以及你的技能。按专精保存（饰品按物品），更新和换装后依然保留。",
  ["How it works"] = "使用说明",
  ["More settings"] = "更多设置",
  ["No potion chosen. Click the box and pick one from your bags: DMGAssist then suggests it in the items badge beside slot 1 when SimC drinks a potion (with your big cooldowns)."] = "未选择药水。点击方框，从背包中选一瓶：之后当 SimC 使用药水时（配合你的大技能），DMGAssist 会在 1 号位旁的物品徽章中提示。",
  ["None equipped: only trinkets with a Use: effect are listed here. Equip one and it shows up."] = "未装备：这里只列出带有“使用：”效果的饰品。装备一个就会出现。",
  ["Open"] = "打开",
  ["Out of combat, a missing buff goes in slot 1: raid buffs, shields, weapon imbues, poisons, and Earth Shield or Beacon of Light on your tank. Each can be hidden on the Spells, trinkets & potion page."] = "脱战时，缺失的增益放到第 1 格：团队增益、护盾、武器强化、毒药，以及坦克身上的大地之盾或圣光道标。每一项都可在“技能、饰品和药水”页面隐藏。",
  ["Pages inside"] = "子页面",
  ["Pick a size and a place: that's all most players need. Everything below is optional fine-tuning; changing it shows Custom here."] = "选择大小和位置：大多数玩家只需要这些。下面都是可选的微调；改动后这里会显示“自定义”。",
  ["Place"] = "位置",
  ["Potion"] = "药水",
  ["Right after it happens: /dmga report (or the minimap menu, or the Report an issue button at the top of this page). Step 1: say what went wrong. Step 2: Ctrl+C copies your words and the report together. Step 3: open the link and paste it into a new issue. /dmga help lists every command."] = "问题发生后立即：/dmga report（或小地图菜单，或 本页顶部的“报告问题”按钮）。第 1 步：说明哪里出了问题。第 2 步：Ctrl+C 会把你的描述和报告一起复制。第 3 步：打开链接并粘贴到新的 issue 中。/dmga help 列出所有命令。",
  ["Right now"] = "当前状态",
  ["Size, layout, fonts, keybind text, badges and what the HUD shows."] = "大小、布局、字体、按键文字、徽章以及 HUD 显示的内容。",
  ["Small, medium or large: the whole HUD, icons and text. Custom: set by the Scale slider below."] = "小、中、大：整个 HUD，包括图标和文字。自定义：由下方的缩放滑块设置。",
  ["Sounds for interrupts, defensives, boss calls and cooldowns."] = "打断、防御、首领提示和冷却的声音。",
  ["Spells"] = "技能",
  ["Spells (notes) slide from right to left into the box on the left. A note reaches the box exactly when it can be pressed: the box flashes, press it then. Perfect, Great or Good says how close you were. Every hit adds to your streak and score (under the lane); every 10 in a row raises the multiplier, up to x4. Stars and a rank (Bronze to Mythic) grow with the streak. A red X: wrong spell, the streak breaks. Waiting (moving, a mechanic, nothing to press) never breaks it."] = "技能（音符）从右向左滑入左侧的方框。音符恰好在可以按下时到达方框：方框闪光时按下。完美、很好、不错表示你有多准。每次命中都会增加连击和分数（在轨道下方）；每连续 10 次倍数提高，最高 x4。星星和段位（青铜到神话）随连击增长。红色 X：按错技能，连击中断。等待（移动、机制、没有可按的）永远不会中断连击。",
  ["Spells, trinkets & potion"] = "技能、饰品和药水",
  ["Spells, trinkets & potion: untick a spell or trinket to never see it, or tick First when ready to put a spell in slot 1 whenever it can be cast. Kept per spec, through updates."] = "技能、饰品和药水：取消勾选某个技能或饰品就不再显示它；勾选“就绪时优先”则只要能施放就把它放在第 1 格。按专精保存，更新后保留。",
  ["The note in the box is always exactly the spell Classic shows: that is never changed. To keep the lane readable, Flow smooths what comes after it: the notes behind only swap when a new pick holds for a third of a second, a spell the rotation keeps putting off is hidden after being passed over three times, notes never slide backwards (they pause and flow on), only one note stands in the box, and the lane pauses when there's nothing to press for 6 seconds. So the lane is calmer than Classic's small icons, never less right about what to press now. Score, streaks and stars are for fun and for learning the rhythm: they never change what is recommended. Flow timing offset (Flow mode & grades) moves the flash for your latency."] = "方框里的音符永远与经典模式显示的技能完全相同：这一点从不改变。为了让轨道易读，Flow 会平滑之后的内容：后面的音符只有在新选择保持三分之一秒后才会替换；循环一再推迟的技能在被跳过三次后隐藏；音符从不后退（会暂停再继续）；方框里只有一个音符；6 秒没有可按的技能时轨道暂停。所以轨道比经典模式的小图标更平稳，但对“现在该按什么”从不更不准确。分数、连击和星星是为了乐趣和学习节奏：它们从不改变推荐内容。Flow 时机偏移（Flow模式与评分）可按你的延迟移动闪光时刻。",
  ["The rhythm-game mode, its timing, and the performance grade."] = "节奏游戏模式、其时机以及表现评分。",
  ["Ticked: may be shown. Unticked: never shown (the next spell takes its place). First when ready: in slot 1 whenever it can be cast (only interrupts, defensives and gap closers come before it)."] = "勾选：可能显示。不勾选：从不显示（由下一个技能补上）。就绪时优先：只要能施放就放在 1 号位（只有打断、防御和突进技能排在它前面）。",
  ["Timing, debugging and the rarely needed switches."] = "时机、调试以及很少用到的开关。",
  ["Turn DMGAssist on or off, move it, and pick its language. More settings are at the bottom of this page."] = "开启或关闭 DMGAssist、移动它并选择语言。更多设置在本页底部。",
  ["Two ways to play"] = "两种玩法",
  ["What DMGAssist sees right now, a guide to Classic and Flow, what every tag, badge and colour means, and Report an issue."] = "DMGAssist 当前看到的状态、经典与 Flow 的指南、每个标签/徽章/颜色的含义，以及报告问题。",
  ["What Flow changes to stay fun"] = "Flow 为了趣味做的调整",
  ["What to recommend, single target or AoE, interrupts, defensives, trinkets, buff reminders and leveling."] = "推荐内容、单体或群体、打断、防御、饰品、增益提醒和升级。",
  ["When the grade shows, what it measures, and its place."] = "评分何时显示、衡量什么以及显示位置。",
  ["Where the HUD sits. Custom: wherever you dragged it (unlock on the first page) or put it in Edit Mode."] = "HUD 的位置。自定义：你拖动到的位置（在第一页解锁）或在编辑模式中放置的位置。",
  ["Yellow bar behind a note: a cast, as long as the cast. Blue bar: a channel. Orange, burning note: a major cooldown, worth double. Faded note: a guess or waiting for resource; it doesn't count as a miss. Lane turns electric blue (POWER MODE!): Bloodlust or right after a major cooldown; every hit scores double. The row above the lane holds bonuses to grab when they're needed: INTERRUPT!, DEFEND! (a defensive or heal) and POWER UP! (a trinket or potion). After a set of pulls (20 seconds out of combat), your performance grade shows."] = "音符后的黄色长条：读条技能，长度等于读条时间。蓝色长条：引导技能。燃烧的橙色音符：大技能，分数翻倍。变淡的音符：猜测或在等待资源；不算失误。轨道变成电光蓝（能量模式！）：嗜血期间或大技能之后；每次命中分数翻倍。轨道上方一行会在需要时出现可抓取的奖励：打断！、防御！（防御或治疗技能）和强化！（饰品或药水）。一组战斗后（脱战 20 秒），会显示你的表现评分。",
  ["Your best grade, recent sets and where to improve, for this spec."] = "本专精的最佳评分、近期战斗组以及改进方向。",
  ["Your potion, your on-use trinkets and every spell, each on or off for this spec."] = "你的药水、可使用饰品和每个技能，按本专精分别开关。",
  ["Custom"] = "自定义",
  ["Just above the action bars"] = "动作条正上方",
  ["Move the HUD"] = "移动 HUD",
  ["COMBO!"] = "连招！",
  ["COMBO %d/%d"] = "连招 %d/%d",
  ["Flow: combos"] = "Flow：连招",
  ["Each spec has a few short chains it plays right after a major cooldown, found in long simulated fights. Press the cooldown and COMBO 1/3 shows over the box; play the chain's next spells in order and COMBO! sweeps the lane violet with bonus points. Another spell, or a pause of more than 6 seconds, quietly ends it. Combos never change what is recommended."] = "每个专精都有几条在大技能之后打出的短连招，来自长时间的模拟战斗。按下大技能后方框上方显示“连招 1/3”；按顺序打出后续技能，“连招！”会让轨道闪过紫光并奖励分数。打出其他技能或停顿超过 6 秒会悄悄结束连招。连招从不改变推荐内容。",
  ["COMBO x%d"] = "连招 x%d",
  ["FLOW STATE!"] = "心流状态！",
  ["COMBO BREAKER!"] = "连招破坏者！",
  ["Flow: Flow State and COMBO BREAKER"] = "Flow：心流状态与连招破坏者",
  ["Small, medium or large: the whole HUD, icons and text. Custom: shows every Display option, to set each one yourself."] = "小、中、大：整个 HUD，包括图标和文字。自定义：显示所有显示选项，由你逐项设置。",
  ["Pick a size and a place: that's all most players need. Set Size to Custom to see every Display option and fine-tune it yourself."] = "选择大小和位置：大多数玩家只需要这些。把大小设为“自定义”即可看到所有显示选项并自行微调。",
  ["When a cooldown comes up with the spells that follow it, the lane links them: violet edges, a violet line between the notes and COMBO x3 over the first. Press them in order: COMBO 1/3 shows over the box as you go, and the last one brings COMBO! with a violet sweep and bonus points. Another spell, or a pause of more than 6 seconds, quietly ends it. Combos never change what is recommended."] = "当大技能和随后的技能一起出现时，轨道会把它们连起来：紫色边框、音符之间的紫色连线，第一个音符上方显示“连招 x3”。按顺序按下：方框上方会显示进度“连招 1/3”，最后一个会带来“连招！”、紫色光扫和奖励分数。打出其他技能或停顿超过 6 秒会悄悄结束连招。连招从不改变推荐内容。",
  ["15 Perfect or Great hits in a row start FLOW STATE: for 12 seconds the lane glows teal and every hit scores double; a miss ends it. Landing an interrupt from the bonus row shows COMBO BREAKER! with a red sweep."] = "连续 15 次完美或很好会开启心流状态：12 秒内轨道发出青绿色光，每次命中分数翻倍；一次失误就会结束。成功打断奖励行里的打断会显示“连招破坏者！”并伴随红色光扫。",
  ["Yellow bar behind a note: a cast, as long as the cast. Blue bar: a channel. Orange, burning note: a major cooldown, worth double. Faded note: a guess or waiting for resource; it doesn't count as a miss. Lane turns electric blue (POWER MODE!): Bloodlust or right after a major cooldown; every hit scores double. The box above the hit box holds the most urgent bonus to grab, one at a time (+1 says another waits): INTERRUPT!, DEFEND! (a defensive or heal) and POWER UP! (a trinket or potion). After a set of pulls (20 seconds out of combat), your performance grade shows."] = "音符后的黄色长条：读条技能，长度等于读条时间。蓝色长条：引导技能。燃烧的橙色音符：大技能，分数翻倍。变淡的音符：猜测或在等待资源；不算失误。轨道变成电光蓝（能量模式！）：嗜血期间或大技能之后；每次命中分数翻倍。命中框上方的方框一次显示一个最紧急的奖励（+1 表示还有一个在等）：打断！、防御！（防御或治疗技能）和强化！（饰品或药水）。一组战斗后（脱战 20 秒），会显示你的表现评分。",
}
